  "title": "Weekly Update 531: Optimizely. Script Dependencies & Third Parties",
  "url": "https://www.troyhunt.com/weekly-update-531/",
  "content": "<img alt=\"Weekly Update 531: Optimizely. Script Dependencies &amp; Third Parties\" src=\"https://storage.ghost.io/c/fb/33/fb3391dc-723d-4e74-b95a-d641b5feb38e/content/images/2026/11/maxresdefault.webp\" /><p>&quot;You can&apos;t outsource accountability&quot;. But it feels like that&apos;s what&apos;s happening when a disclosure notice refers to &quot;an incident being at a third party&quot;, as though somehow that makes it better. It feels like the intent is to deflect <em>responsibility</em>, but ultimately, <em>accountability </em>remains with the party we entrusted our data to in the first place. It&apos;s also ultimately them who needs to decide whether to disclose the incident, so in the case of Optimizely this week, even though it&apos;s clearly their fault, it&apos;s up to the likes of Norwegian Airlines to decide whether they&apos;re contacting impacted individuals. And then, in their case, they haven&apos;t named the third party anyway! Strange times, I reckon.</p>\n<!--kg-card-begin: html-->\n<div><div style=\"width: 170px; display: inline-block; margin-right: 3px;\"><a href=\"https://itunes.apple.com/au/podcast/troy-hunts-weekly-update-podcast/id1176454699?ref=troy-hunt\"><img alt=\"Weekly Update 531: Optimizely. Script Dependencies &amp; Third Parties\" src=\"https://storage.ghost.io/c/fb/33/fb3391dc-723d-4e74-b95a-d641b5feb38e/content/images/2018/05/Listen-on-Apple-Podcasts.svg\" /></a></div><div style=\"width: 175px; display: inline-block; margin-right: 3px;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL7LAAxaabizMAXnJe0s3xjQ30q12EVmjt&amp;ref=troyhunt.com\"><img alt=\"Weekly Update 531: Optimizely. Script Dependencies &amp; Third Parties\" src=\"https://storage.ghost.io/c/fb/33/fb3391dc-723d-4e74-b95a-d641b5feb38e/content/images/2024/09/Watch-and-Listen-on-YouTube.svg\" /></a></div><div style=\"width: 118px; display: inline-block; margin-right: 3px;\"><a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/show/7jMtKFohdrw6qmz8AkLqit?ref=troy-hunt\"><img alt=\"Weekly Update 531: Optimizely. Script Dependencies &amp; Third Parties\" class=\"kg-image\" src=\"https://storage.ghost.io/c/fb/33/fb3391dc-723d-4e74-b95a-d641b5feb38e/content/images/2019/10/spotify.svg\" /></a></div><div style=\"width: 120px; display: inline-block;\"><a href=\"https://omny.fm/shows/troy-hunt-weekly-update/playlists/podcast.rss?ref=troy-hunt\"><img alt=\"Weekly Update 531: Optimizely. Script Dependencies &amp; Third Parties\" src=\"https://storage.ghost.io/c/fb/33/fb3391dc-723d-4e74-b95a-d641b5feb38e/content/images/2018/07/Download-via-RSS.svg\" /></a></div></div>\n<!--kg-card-end: html-->"
